    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "Size: 28 mm\n\nA mysterious animal that lived in isolation.\n\nAuthor note:
    This book is meant to teach science, and a part of science, is doubt.\nNo one
    knows what the organisms during the cambrian looked like, and every drawing seen
    today is in many ways, an artistic interpretation, and is also probably inaccurate.\n\nThe
    depiction of dinomischus seen in this storybook is inaccurate for several reasons:
    \ \n\nDinomischus is an animal: not a plant (hence the green coloring is false.)\nDinomischus
    grew in isolated areas, not clumped together.\n\n\n"
